{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HARK THE GHOUL</strong> is a dungeon crawler where behind every corner lies a discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep, handcrafted world that feels tangible and immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face terrifying monsters, challenge awe-inspiring foes and meet curious characters along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/9ef21b3dac9ae23e9df307fc3a6ed605.poster.avif?t=1771410954\" width=620 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/9ef21b3dac9ae23e9df307fc3a6ed605.webm?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/9ef21b3dac9ae23e9df307fc3a6ed605.mp4?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/33e15cb23cd8b439dcb515b70de96eb3.poster.avif?t=1771410954\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/33e15cb23cd8b439dcb515b70de96eb3.webm?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIGHT AND TWISTING LEVEL DESIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in a myriad of seamlessly interconnected zones as you descend down the bowels of the earth and uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/fe8f1fa11d5d991ba730eed66f3a9fba.poster.avif?t=1771410954\" width=620 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/fe8f1fa11d5d991ba730eed66f3a9fba.webm?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/fe8f1fa11d5d991ba730eed66f3a9fba.mp4?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TONS OF UNIQUE GEAR TO FIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use swords, whips, pistols, cannons, artifacts, employ magic to tear your way through your enemies. Every piece of gear has its unique utility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/65a837ca3e3e2ba6b0a94805cce915af.poster.avif?t=1771410954\" width=620 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/65a837ca3e3e2ba6b0a94805cce915af.webm?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/65a837ca3e3e2ba6b0a94805cce915af.mp4?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRISP RETRO-MODERN GRAPHICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HARK THE GHOUL's compelling world is lovingly rendered in a retro-modern low-poly style (with customizable effects!).  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/0eac4c95f5849dce772531e76fc68ab2.poster.avif?t=1771410954\" width=620 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/0eac4c95f5849dce772531e76fc68ab2.webm?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/0eac4c95f5849dce772531e76fc68ab2.mp4?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/5689d82deafbdb5f091923e46d948163.poster.avif?t=1771410954\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/5689d82deafbdb5f091923e46d948163.webm?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hark the Ghoul!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A damp, dark victorian city sits under a starless sky. Its citizens, mad with desire, claw at the earth, hoping to dig up shreds of amber. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the city lie lands untold. Darkness, teeming with unimaginable horrors and fantastic creatures. And deep within, a glint draws the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hark the Ghoul!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/73ed941ab26838fc77fe05de8bbefd26.avif?t=1771410954\" width=606 height=572 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3058660?t=1771410954","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771410954","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/3aab47f9367e83f68d2e6fc671d93de46d812cb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771410954","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/3aab47f9367e83f68d2e6fc671d93de46d812cb4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771410954","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains light gore, rare mentions of self-harm, suicide."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3132850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HARK THE GHOUL</strong> is a dungeon crawler where behind every corner lies a discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep, handcrafted world that feels tangible and immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face terrifying monsters, challenge awe-inspiring foes and meet curious characters along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/9ef21b3dac9ae23e9df307fc3a6ed605.poster.avif?t=1771410954\" width=620 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/9ef21b3dac9ae23e9df307fc3a6ed605.webm?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/9ef21b3dac9ae23e9df307fc3a6ed605.mp4?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/33e15cb23cd8b439dcb515b70de96eb3.poster.avif?t=1771410954\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/33e15cb23cd8b439dcb515b70de96eb3.webm?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIGHT AND TWISTING LEVEL DESIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in a myriad of seamlessly interconnected zones as you descend down the bowels of the earth and uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/fe8f1fa11d5d991ba730eed66f3a9fba.poster.avif?t=1771410954\" width=620 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/fe8f1fa11d5d991ba730eed66f3a9fba.webm?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/fe8f1fa11d5d991ba730eed66f3a9fba.mp4?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TONS OF UNIQUE GEAR TO FIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use swords, whips, pistols, cannons, artifacts, employ magic to tear your way through your enemies. Every piece of gear has its unique utility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/65a837ca3e3e2ba6b0a94805cce915af.poster.avif?t=1771410954\" width=620 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/65a837ca3e3e2ba6b0a94805cce915af.webm?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/65a837ca3e3e2ba6b0a94805cce915af.mp4?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRISP RETRO-MODERN GRAPHICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HARK THE GHOUL's compelling world is lovingly rendered in a retro-modern low-poly style (with customizable effects!).  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/0eac4c95f5849dce772531e76fc68ab2.poster.avif?t=1771410954\" width=620 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/0eac4c95f5849dce772531e76fc68ab2.webm?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/0eac4c95f5849dce772531e76fc68ab2.mp4?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/5689d82deafbdb5f091923e46d948163.poster.avif?t=1771410954\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/5689d82deafbdb5f091923e46d948163.webm?t=1771410954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hark the Ghoul!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A damp, dark victorian city sits under a starless sky. Its citizens, mad with desire, claw at the earth, hoping to dig up shreds of amber. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the city lie lands untold. Darkness, teeming with unimaginable horrors and fantastic creatures. And deep within, a glint draws the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hark the Ghoul!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058660/extras/73ed941ab26838fc77fe05de8bbefd26.avif?t=1771410954\" width=606 height=572 /></span></p>","developers":["Deep Denizens"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"he